'''Hapoel Ramat Gan Givatayim F.C.''' ({{langx|he|מועדון כדורגל הפועל רמת-גן גבעתיים}}, ''Moadon Kaduregel Hapoel Ramat Gan Givatayim'') is an Israeli [[association football|football]] club from [[Ramat Gan]] and [[Givatayim]]. They currently play in the [[Israeli Premier League]], the first tier of Israeli football. Home matches are played at [[Ramat Gan Stadium]], which has a capacity of 13,370. Their regular home strip is all-red.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Hapoel Ramat Gan |url=https://betsapi.com/t/44566/Hapoel-Ramat-Gan |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240426132004/https://betsapi.com/t/44566/Hapoel-Ramat-Gan |archive-date=2024-04-26 |access-date=2025-11-08 |website=betsapi.com |language=en}}</ref>"}}
